        {
          "text": "Gikenyo malaika ma jameni okwanyo tele marom kodi kidi m'irego gine, to bolo i nam munyo waco ni, “Me apaka tindi madwoŋ ma Babilon ibino rwadho piny gi derino, aka kilanenere kendo. ",
